<item><title>Gabon’s parliament cuts 2027 budget by 224,6 milliards de francs CFA</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-s-parliament-cuts-2027-budget-by-224-6-milliards-de-bfd551/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-s-parliament-cuts-2027-budget-by-224-6-milliards-de-bfd551/</guid><category>Gabon</category><description>Deputies approved the revised budget unanimously after lowering the initial envelope from 6 223,1 to 5 998,5 milliards de francs CFA.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:53:58 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-s-parliament-cuts-2027-budget-by-224-6-milliards-de-bfd551/share.jpg" length="43505" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ga/gabon-s-parliament-cuts-2027-budget-by-224-6-milliards-de-bfd551/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
